# Figma

- Treat the approved Figma file as source of truth only when the user says so.
- Inspect structure, spacing, typography, and tokens before coding.
- Map Figma variables to code tokens; do not blindly paste generated code.
- Prefer semantic HTML/CSS over image exports when possible.
- Ask for clarification when the design is ambiguous; do not invent missing specs.
- Never store Figma tokens in the repository.
